maned-kotlin
============

The Kotlin source in this distribution is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see
LICENSE).

The per-platform classifier jars (macos-universal, linux-x86_64,
linux-aarch64) additionally bundle, under native/<target>/, an unmodified
copy of the Maned embedding library (libmaned_c), which is NOT open source.
It is redistributed under section 3 ("Redistributable Components") of the
Maned End User License Agreement — see LICENSE-libmaned_c. That licence
permits use and unmodified redistribution, and does not permit reverse
engineering or modification of the library.

The main jar contains no binary: without a classifier jar on the classpath,
the library is resolved from $MANED_LIBRARY_PATH or a maned-capi release
tarball from https://github.com/FabianoDicheti/maned/releases
